id: pm-o0tkr6
title: Avoid mutation-output flags when recovering an unsupported read projection
description: "During telemetry verification, pm telemetry status --full --json refuses the unsupported projection but suggests replacing --full with --full-changed-fields. The replacement is executable yet unrelated to the requested read detail. Rank correction candidates by semantic purpose and command support, and prefer command-help guidance when no equivalent projection exists."
