author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce the exact status request in isolation; retain unknown_option and declared-elsewhere diagnostics; verify CLI/SDK/MCP ranking without inventing unsupported flags; meaningful pre-fix controls and context-token gates pass.
parent: pm-f05lsg
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Filter lexical corrections through shared SDK semantic purpose and preserve unsupported read projection intent in retry guidance, including abbreviated flags."
expected_result: Unsupported --full or --ful reads guide toward supported controls or help and never become mutation receipt flags or lose projection intent.
actual_result: "Pre-fix exact and abbreviated controls reproduced full-changed-fields suggestions. Nine focused recovery cases now pass; invalid_projection_suggestions=0. Complete10327-test source suite, exact100/100/100/100 coverage, token/context and static gates pass without lowering ceilings or assertions."
