  "2026-10-12T21:20:14.419Z","harness:codex","Active combined delivery with pm-extension-read-output-controls: filter lexical nearest-option candidates by the shared read-output/mutation purpose before generating retry guidance. Retain supported typo corrections and declared-elsewhere diagnostics; verify the exact telemetry status request plus SDK/MCP recovery surfaces."
  "2026-10-12T21:41:02.866Z","harness:codex","Regression evidence: the unchanged exact telemetry status --full test failed before the fix with full-changed-fields as its nearest option and passes after the shared semantic filter. Projection intent cannot silently disappear from fallback retries. Positive typo corrections and all three lexicon scope classes remain covered."
  "2026-10-12T22:21:14.085Z","harness:codex","Additional isolated pre-fix control: the abbreviation --ful also suggested full-changed-fields on telemetry status. Extended presentation-purpose recognition to short declared prefixes while preserving longer full-chang mutation-receipt intent. The same item owns this related correction; tests now cover both requests, ordinary typos, and compatible intentional receipt options. First full suite ran10327 tests with10323 passed and3 platform skips; its single failure was host npm/package.json resolution, not the change. Rerun exposes the installed npm module through NODE_PATH without changing product code or lowering tests/coverage."
  "2026-10-13T01:16:58.717Z","harness:codex","Hosted acceptance in PR1454 at75f9cd861d1cbd2238588a239e02c01f30b46963: required CI and analyzers pass, CodeRabbit full review has no actionable findings, and there are no review threads. Other requested review providers report quota/trial unavailability. The measured zero invalid projection suggestions and immutable pre-fix/fixed evidence remain the recovery acceptance; no unsupported provider approval is claimed."
